  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals negative 2 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"3 x plus y equals 40\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <em>x</em>?</p>",
