  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"40\"><mn>40</mn>\n</math>. It&rsquo;s given in the first equation of the system that <math alttext=\"y equals minus 2 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"minus 2 x\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>2</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> in the second equation of the system yields <math alttext=\"3 x plus left parenthesis minus 2 x right parenthesis equals 40\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math>. Combining like terms on the left-hand side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"x equals 40\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>40</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"40\"><mn>40</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
